# Pairs with ReadRequiresActiveGrant. The active tenant is an assertion; a
# crossing that does not validate it lets any subject consume B's grants.
MODULE: ReadSkipsActiveTenantValidation
TARGET: ReadRequiresActiveGrant
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the crossing branch does not validate the reader's right to act as the grantee
PERTURBS: Read

--- FIND
        actsAsB == rdr \in Members /\ status["B"] = "active"
--- REPLACE
        actsAsB == status["B"] = "active"
--- END